        {
            "content": "So, I can kinda, I can run through the pricing with you. It's super simple. You don't need to take any notes. So for a move like this, we would send one truck and two movers and our hourly rate for a two man crew is $218 per hour and it starts when they get on site, it is all inclusive, we don't have any trip fees, there's no taxes. There's no credit card fees. We pad and wrap all the furniture to make sure nothing gets damaged and everything's fully insured. In case anything did happen to get damaged. We also have tools for disassemble and reassembly of things like the bed frames all that's included in the rate and then the way that it works is we do a 2.5 hour minimum which is $545 once we exceed the minimum we bill in fifteen minute increments until the move is completed so you would just pay for the time need to pass that day does that all make sense.",
